---
// src/components/Component_17.astro
---
<section class="w-full bg-[var(--neutral-text-inverted)] py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-10">
        <div class="border-[3px] border-[#9981DC] rounded-lg p-4 max-w-3xl text-center">
            <p class="text-[var(--neutral-background-strong)] text-base">
                <strong>¡Un torneo de golf diferente!</strong>
                <span class="hidden sm:inline"> Sin suspensiones por lluvia, más social y fácil de planificar.</span>
                <a href="#" class="font-semibold text-[var(--brand-interactive-base)] hover:underline ml-1">Más información</a>
            </p>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[var(--neutral-background-strong)] max-w-4xl">
            ¿Tienes dudas? <span class="font-serif italic">o algo más en mente</span>
        </h2>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4 mt-4">
            <a href="#"
                class="bg-[var(--brand-interactive-base)] text-[var(--neutral-text-inverted)] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider py-3 px-8 rounded-full shadow-lg transition-colors duration-300 ease-in-out">
                Solicitar Información
            </a>
            <a href="#"
                class="border-2 border-[var(--brand-interactive-base)] text-[var(--brand-interactive-base)] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider py-3 px-8 rounded-full transition-colors duration-300 ease-in-out">
                Platica con un ejecutivo
            </a>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>